---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Now | David Wayne Baxter"
  description="What David Wayne Baxter is doing right now: job search, active projects, and current focus areas. Updated October 2026."
  canonical="/now/"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://davidwaynebaxter.com/" },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Now", "item": "https://davidwaynebaxter.com/now/" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "url": "https://davidwaynebaxter.com/now/",
        "name": "Now | David Wayne Baxter",
        "description": "What David Wayne Baxter is doing right now.",
        "dateModified": "2026-10-03"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>
<main id="main">
    <div class="wrap">

      <div class="page-head">
        <p class="mono">Now</p>
        <h1>What I&rsquo;m doing right now.</h1>
        <p class="lede">A snapshot of where my focus is. Updated October 2026, from Los Angeles.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="row first" aria-labelledby="work-now">
        <div class="label">Work</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h2 id="work-now">Looking for the next role.</h2>
          <p>I left Fanatics Betting and Gaming in September 2026 after three and a half years leading platform engineering teams. I am actively searching for Senior Engineering Manager and Director of Engineering roles, at organizations where I can do the same kind of work: building the systems, process, and people that make an engineering organization reliable and fast.</p>
          <p>If you are hiring or know someone who is, <a class="textlink" href="/contact/">reach out</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="row" aria-labelledby="building-now">
        <div class="label">Building</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h2 id="building-now">Active projects.</h2>
          <div class="principle">
            <h3>AI-augmented engineering workflows</h3>
            <p>Extending the work I started at Fanatics: agents that do defined jobs inside an engineering organization. Currently focused on agentic software development, autonomous operations, and what it looks like to design a team for human + AI collaboration.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="principle">
            <h3>Self-hosted infrastructure</h3>
            <p>Running a home lab on Proxmox: networking, containers, observability, Home Assistant, and a deliberate move away from cloud-managed services toward infrastructure I own and understand. <a class="textlink" href="/lab/">See the lab&nbsp;→</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="principle">
            <h3>This site</h3>
            <p>Writing more, building out the Ideas section, and treating davidwaynebaxter.com as a live artifact of how I think, not just a résumé placeholder.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="row" aria-labelledby="reading-now">
        <div class="label">Exploring</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h2 id="reading-now">Current focus areas.</h2>
          <ul class="plain">
            <li>Organizational design for human + AI teams</li>
            <li>Agentic software development</li>
            <li>Developer experience and engineering operating systems</li>
            <li>Self-hosted and private infrastructure</li>
            <li>AI-assisted engineering management</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="mono muted" style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        This is a <a class="textlink" href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="noopener" target="_blank">/now page</a>. Updated October 2026.
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
